summary:
  The listener's own level is the saved one until the save, a second after
  the gesture.

history:
  The wheel took a widget from 80 % to 20 % beside a device; a move of the
  room's slider inside that second worked the device's level out of the 80
  and sent 0.200 to a device that stood at 0.060.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TransportLogic.js

find:
      var pct = (Number.isFinite(pendingPct) && pendingPct > 0) ? pendingPct

replace:
      var pct = (Number.isFinite(pendingPct) && pendingPct > 100) ? pendingPct

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_transportlogic.qml::test_a_gesture_not_yet_saved_is_already_the_level
  and tests/qml/tst_volumeroad.qml::test_the_rooms_slider_inside_that_second_works_from_the_level_the_wheel_just_set.
  Line-neutral.
